# Remotion AI authoring skills (remotion-dev/skills) are PREPACKED: tracked in
# .agents/skills/ and symlinked from .claude/skills/ so agents building the site
# hero find them without installing anything. Refresh with
# `npx skills add remotion-dev/skills`. The installer also symlinks into the
# runtime skills/ dir — those must never ship in the pack, so they stay ignored:
skills/mediabunny
skills/remotion-*
